<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Criminal Procedure Code (Amendment)(Amendment) Act 2007."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister under subsection 1(2) of the Criminal Procedure Code (Amendment) Act 2006 [Act A1274]. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Criminal Procedure Code (Amendment) Act 2006, which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in paragraph 2(b), in the English language text, in the definition, by substituting for the words \"youth offender\" the words \"youthful offender\". Amendment of section 4"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 4 the following section: \"4. Paragraph 13(1)(a) of the Code is amended by inserting after the words \"369,\" the words \"372, 372A, 372B, 376, 376B, 377C, 377CA, 377E,\". Amendment of section 5"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 5 the following section: \"5. The Code is amended by inserting after section 20 the following section: \"Procedure on search of a person 20A. (1) Any search of a person shall comply with the procedure on body search as specified in the Fourth Schedule of this Code."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any written law, the provisions of the Fourth Schedule shall apply to any search of a person conducted by any officer of any enforcement agency conferred with the power of arrest or search of a person under any law."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
