<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The police officer giving the authorization under subsection (9) shall record the grounds of belief of the police officer that the conditions specified under subsection (8) will arise and such record shall be made as soon as practicable."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
