<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection (8) shall only apply upon authorization by a police officer not below the rank of Deputy Superintendent of Police."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
