<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this section shall be deemed to apply to any statement made in the course of an identification parade or falling within section 27 or paragraphs 32(1)(a), (i) and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/14/eng@> .
